25:[["$","title","0",{"children":"Landing Page CTA Audit: Placement & Contrast Guide | Nebula"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"description","content":"Landing page CTAs fail for specific, observable reasons: generic labels with no outcome, multiple CTAs at equal visual weight, below-fold placement, and contrast ratios that fail WCAG AA. This guide covers each failure with the signal, the finding, and the fix."}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"manifest","href":"/manifest.webmanifest","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","3",{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://nebulacomponents.com/landing-page-cta-audit"}],["$","meta","4",{"property":"og:title","content":"Landing Page CTA Audit: Placement & Contrast Guide | Nebula"}],["$","meta","5",{"property":"og:description","content":"Landing page CTAs fail for specific, observable reasons: generic labels with no outcome, multiple CTAs at equal visual weight, below-fold placement, and contrast ratios that fail WCAG AA."}],["$","meta","6",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://nebulacomponents.com/landing-page-cta-audit"}],["$","meta","7",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"Nebula Components"}],["$","meta","8",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}],["$","meta","9",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image"}],["$","meta","10",{"name":"twitter:creator","content":"@NebulaCRO"}],["$","meta","11",{"name":"twitter:title","content":"Find Failed Page Conditions on Your Landing Page | Nebula Components"}],["$","meta","12",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Free landing page audit that finds failed page conditions on public HTML. Evidence-backed, no signup, results in under 2 minutes."}],["$","meta","13",{"name":"twitter:image","content":"https://nebulacomponents.com/brand/v2/og-default.png"}],["$","link","14",{"rel":"shortcut icon","href":"/favicon.svg"}],["$","link","15",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.svg","type":"image/svg+xml"}],["$","link","16",{"rel":"icon","href":"/brand/v2/favicon-32.png","sizes":"32x32","type":"image/png"}],["$","link","17",{"rel":"icon","href":"/brand/v2/favicon-16.png","sizes":"16x16","type":"image/png"}],["$","link","18",{"rel":"apple-touch-icon","href":"/brand/v2/apple-touch-icon.png"}],["$","$L39","19",{}]]
